+# MOC 2 - Thi nghiem B (THUAT TOAN dung chung bo loc) tren TAP TEST UA-DETRAC (40 video), c25, cau hinh KHOA
+# (LOCK_moc2.md). Baseline = SORT nguyen ban (sort-orig1). Moi cap chi doi MOT yeu to (PHASE2_REPORT muc 7.2):
+#   sort-orig1 -> sort-orig30 : bo dem (max_age 1 -> 30)
+#   sort-orig30 -> sort-cv30  : bieu dien trang thai + nhieu (KF 7-D [u,v,s,r] -> KalmanFilterXYAH), cung vong doi SORT
+#   sort-cv30 -> sort-ekf30   : motion model (CV -> EKF-CTRV), cung xyah, cung vong doi SORT
+#   sort-orig1 -> sort-ekf1   : chi doi bo loc, giu vong doi nguyen ban (max_age 1)
+#   sort-ekf30 -> bt-ekf      : vong doi/association (SORT -> ByteTrack)
+name: expB_detrac_test
+dataset: detrac
+split_name: DETRAC-test
+part: test
+manifest: results/phase2/manifests/detrac_test.json
+cache_id: yolov8n-coco_conf0.05_all
+classes: [2, 3, 5, 7]
+max_det: 300
+fps: 25
+elapsed_mode: skip
+conditions:
