++    - frame 15 rong (0 detection)                                                    -> n_steps = 1, track -> LOST
++    - xe A di thang 5 px/buoc (toa do theo THOI GIAN, nen du doan k buoc phai khop)
++    - xe B chi co frame 1-5 -> LOST tu frame 6; track_buffer = 6 buoc:
